          "text": " Aha nyigi ez'ekishengye ekya rwagati hakaba hasharwirweho ebishushani bya baakerubi n'emikindo, nk'ebyababire bisharwirwe aha bisiika; kandi omu maisho g'ekisasi ky'aheeru hakaba hariho ekisanga ky'embaaho. ",
